# <type>(<scope>): <short imperative summary>  (max 72 chars)
#
# <body — wrap at 72 chars; explain what & why, not how>
#
# <footer — list breaking changes, issue refs, co-authors>
#
# Types: feat | fix | docs | style | refactor | test | chore | perf | build | ci
# Scope examples: giotto | gauntlet | spine | engines | docs | tests | deploy
#
# Examples:
#   feat(giotto): integrate Giotto.ai sponsor (client, env, claim email)
#   fix(consensus): cap HITL when conviction >= established
#   chore(git): professionalize repo — commit template, PR template, .gitattributes
#

